Program 05. Package with Methods
=========================

Creates a Calculator class in package mathops and invokes its methods from another package.

File 1: mathops/Calculator.java

package mathops;

public class Calculator {
    public int add(int a, int b) {
        return a + b;
    }

    public int multiply(int a, int b) {
        return a * b;
    }
}

File 2: runner/Program05_PackageMethods.java

package runner;

